#2000
The Beach of Draconia Isle~
You have landed on the beach of the legendary Isle of Draconia. It is rumored
that the King of Draconia does NOT welcome visitors nor do any of his subjects.
It is also said that he has employed several dragons from the nearby City of
Dragonnia to guard and protect his realm. You would be well advised to leave
this island now while you still have the chance.
~
